The [[Stamina Sack]] is an epic [[Bag]] available in the shop for all classes. It gives three backpack slots, and gives 1 maximum stamina.

The [[Bagtacular]] skill gives the [[Stamina Sack]] the additional property of increasing stamina regeneration 5%, which is a more effective long-term way of ensuring that stamina isn't fully depleted.
